OL,3,GNEWSAI stole #1,000 a day to feed my
OL,4,Aaddiction - now I've turned my life
OL,5,Aaround
OL,6,
OL,7,FA former shoplifter who stole goods
OL,8,Fworth up to #1,000 a day to fuel his
OL,9,Fdrug addiction says his life has been
OL,10,Fturned around by a support scheme.
OL,12,FRhys Davies, from Dudley, said his
OL,13,Fissues with substance abuse began
OL,14,Fduring the Covid-19 pandemic when he
OL,15,Flost his ability to work and what had
OL,16,Fbeen social drug use became more
OL,17,Fserious.
OL,19,F"Life was very chaotic back then," he
OL,20,Fsaid. "Everything revolved around my
OL,21,Fdrug addiction."
